        "original_id": "d4768adb-8c93-5062-a552-0bd952ba8be9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: “Mmm Papi”, “La Isla Bonita”, “True Blue”\n- People: Madonna, Patrick Leonard, Bruce Gaitsch\n- Topics: Latin pop influence\n\nFacts:\n- In 1986, Madonna released the third studio album “True Blue”, which includes the song “La Isla Bonita”.\n- In 1987, Madonna’s song “La Isla Bonita” was noted as a Latin pop song reference point.\n- Madonna co-wrote and co-produced “La Isla Bonita” with Patrick Leonard.\n- Bruce Gaitsch provided additional songwriting for “La Isla Bonita”.\n- “Mmm Papi” is noted for having a Latin pop influence similar to Madonna’s 1987 song “La Isla Bonita”.",
